================================================================================
Third-Party Components
================================================================================

blamejs vendors third-party libraries under lib/vendor/ rather than peer-
depending them through npm. Each vendored component retains its original
copyright and license. Bundle versions and source SHAs are tracked in
lib/vendor/MANIFEST.json. License texts for each vendored component are
preserved under lib/vendor/LICENSES/.

(No third-party components vendored yet — entries will be added as the
framework grows. Each entry below should follow this format:)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Component:   <package name>
Version:     <vendored version>
Source:      <upstream URL>
License:     <SPDX identifier>
Copyright:   <upstream copyright line>
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
